; TinyLibSystem's parts (../TinyLibSystem.mli, the interface, and its
; library in ../dune, beside it, as dune wants a virtual module's .mli):
; an implementation for each system it runs on, in the directories here
; (README.md):
;
; - unix/, over OCaml's Unix (Linux, macOS), the default;
; - tinykernel/, over tiny-kernel's calls, compiled by tiny-ml (no dune
;   file: TinyKernel/Makefile);
; - sdl/ and teststub/: TinyCalls.mli's, the kernel's calls themselves,
;   what a graphical program draws and reads its keys with, in a window
;   on the host or in the tests (tinykernel/'s are the kernel's own).
;
; (TinyCalls joins TinyLibSystem: docs/plans/plan_tiny_one_system.md)

(library
 (name tiny_calls)
 (wrapped false)
 (modules TinyCalls)
 (virtual_modules TinyCalls)
 (default_implementation tiny_calls_teststub))
